{"2590730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Multiplayer Supermarket Simulator", "steam_appid": 2590730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In <i>Multiplayer Supermarket Simulator</i>, you take on the role of a supermarket manager. This is a top-down perspective game where you can personally handle every aspect of running a supermarket—from operating cash registers to managing warehouse inventory, and even hiring NPC staff. Every choice you make will influence your customers' decisions. You can play alone, or team up with friends in the online co-op mode to expand your store and build the supermarket of your dreams.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You will start by taking over a small supermarket.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590730/extras/b6d881d8931688b1ce95e8d92c562846.avif?t=1771526115\" width=1530 height=586 /></span>Design your store, optimize efficiency and decor, define product categories and their placement, and help customers find the goods they need more quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590730/extras/518d92192d0f9edacbfe2428aaa9665b.avif?t=1771526115\" width=1560 height=486 /></span>Supports multiple ordering methods. Order goods via computers for fast and efficient home delivery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590730/extras/fd83b9b1807c11a36b24c592401411e9.avif?t=1771526115\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590730/extras_big/fd83b9b1807c11a36b24c592401411e9.avif?t=1771526115 width=1560 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or drive your purchased car to make offline purchases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590730/extras/94cae2358f88b58104af3db13d9b7ff8.avif?t=1771526115\" width=888 height=340 /></span>Place your goods on the shelves, set the optimal prices, and open for business!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire employees to process customer payments and earn your first fortune!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590730/extras/17d2a4fe25405d43daaf10fd7f4a2ba7.avif?t=1771526115\" width=1022 height=412 /></span>Level up your store and unlock more sales licenses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your store space, add your favorite decorations, and provide customers with a better shopping experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590730/extras/5c5e827bc1530b6ed14902ca7985917e.avif?t=1771526115\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590730/extras_big/5c5e827bc1530b6ed14902ca7985917e.avif?t=1771526115 width=1560 height=754 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In <i>Multiplayer Supermarket Simulator</i>, you take on the role of a supermarket manager. This is a top-down perspective game where you can personally handle every aspect of running a supermarket—from operating cash registers to managing warehouse inventory, and even hiring NPC staff. Every choice you make will influence your customers' decisions. You can play alone, or team up with friends in the online co-op mode to expand your store and build the supermarket of your dreams.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You will start by taking over a small supermarket.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590730/extras/b6d881d8931688b1ce95e8d92c562846.avif?t=1771526115\" width=1530 height=586 /></span>Design your store, optimize efficiency and decor, define product categories and their placement, and help customers find the goods they need more quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590730/extras/518d92192d0f9edacbfe2428aaa9665b.avif?t=1771526115\" width=1560 height=486 /></span>Supports multiple ordering methods. Order goods via computers for fast and efficient home delivery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590730/extras/fd83b9b1807c11a36b24c592401411e9.avif?t=1771526115\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590730/extras_big/fd83b9b1807c11a36b24c592401411e9.avif?t=1771526115 width=1560 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or drive your purchased car to make offline purchases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590730/extras/94cae2358f88b58104af3db13d9b7ff8.avif?t=1771526115\" width=888 height=340 /></span>Place your goods on the shelves, set the optimal prices, and open for business!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire employees to process customer payments and earn your first fortune!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590730/extras/17d2a4fe25405d43daaf10fd7f4a2ba7.avif?t=1771526115\" width=1022 height=412 /></span>Level up your store and unlock more sales licenses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your store space, add your favorite decorations, and provide customers with a better shopping experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590730/extras/5c5e827bc1530b6ed14902ca7985917e.avif?t=1771526115\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590730/extras_big/5c5e827bc1530b6ed14902ca7985917e.avif?t=1771526115 width=1560 height=754 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Run your own supermarket with your buddy! Set product categories/prices, handle checkout, hire staff, expand your store, source goods, grow &amp; sell crops, build town relations, and become the town’s richest resident!", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590730/6c9a290f5bbeb6771655fd0378e19430648f429f/header.jpg?t=1771526115", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590730/c35ff034d52bc80e2e3d0876460bbdfa29d5d7a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771526115", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590730/c35ff034d52bc80e2e3d0876460bbdfa29d5d7a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771526115", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> window7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> I5-8400<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> window7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> I5-94